Looking at the current code in `/app/expensify/src/components/PopoverMenu.tsx`, the `selectItem` function (lines 244-271) already handles calling `onSelected` directly within the function. It doesn't use a `selectedItemIndex` state pattern at all - the current code has already been refactored.

